{"sections":[{"slug":"形模态","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形模态"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">形模态</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“形模态”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\int$ <span lang=\"zh\">将一个对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或基本</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span>. $\\int X$ <span lang=\"zh\">可视为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">形</span>”.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">伴随三元组</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们有形模态</span>-"},{"Local":{"url":"/降模态","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">降模态</span>"}},{"Plain":"-"},{"Local":{"url":"/升模态","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">升模态</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的伴随三元组</span>\n$$\r\n\\int \\dashv \\flat \\dashv \\sharp.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}